  "source": "message/dat/French/script/class_g_03.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/French/script/class_g_03.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_01",
      "hash64": "160D27AC1FC1874F",
      "text": "Bonjour à tous ! Rangez vos téléphones,\\nje vous prie. Le cours va commencer.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_02",
      "hash64": "160D28AC1FC18902",
      "text": "Lors de notre précédente leçon, je vous ai parlé\\nde la récupération de PV.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_03",
      "hash64": "160D29AC1FC18AB5",
      "text": "Mais après le cours, certains d’entre vous m’ont\\ninterrogé au sujet des [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]Points de Pouvoir[VAR 0xFF00(0000)],\\r\\nque l’on appelle communément [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]PP[VAR 0xFF00(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_04",
      "hash64": "160D22AC1FC17ED0",
      "text": "Je vais tâcher de clarifier ce point.\\c\\nBien, nous savons qu’un Pokémon qui a perdu\\ntous ses PV est mis K.O. et ne peut plus se battre.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_05",
      "hash64": "160D23AC1FC18083",
      "text": "Mais savez-vous ce qu’il se passe lorsqu’un\\nPokémon n’a plus de PP ?[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_g_03_select_01",
      "hash64": "DB0694D3DE259316",
      "text": "Il ne peut plus utiliser ses capacités.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_g_03_select_02",
      "hash64": "DB0693D3DE259163",
      "text": "Il arrête d’obéir.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_g_03_select_03",
      "hash64": "DB0692D3DE258FB0",
      "text": "Toutes ses stats baissent.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_answer_01",
      "hash64": "8EEEDB593E4FB2B8",
      "text": "Excellente réponse, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]. Bravo !\\nEn aurais-tu déjà fait l’expérience, par hasard ?[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_answer_02",
      "hash64": "8EEEDE593E4FB7D1",
      "text": "Cela serait en effet une situation préoccupante,\\nmais ce n’est pas la bonne réponse.\\c\\nC’est le nombre de Badges que vous possédez\\nqui détermine si les Pokémon obéissent ou non.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 178,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_answer_03",
      "hash64": "8EEEDD593E4FB61E",
      "text": "Cela serait en effet une situation préoccupante,\\nmais ce n’est pas la bonne réponse.\\c\\nCe n’est pas dans ce sens que « Points de\\nPouvoir » est utilisé ici.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 156,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_06",
      "hash64": "160D24AC1FC18236",
      "text": "Formulons-le ainsi : quand un Pokémon n’a plus\\nde PP, il ne peut plus utiliser ses capacités.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_07",
      "hash64": "160D25AC1FC183E9",
      "text": "Cependant, les PP ne sont pas partagés entre\\nles capacités. En effet, chaque capacité a\\r\\nun nombre de PP qui lui est propre.\\c\\nAinsi, en variant les capacités durant les combats,\\nles PP de chacune baisseront moins rapidement.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 126,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 228,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_08",
      "hash64": "160D2EAC1FC19334",
      "text": "Et si un Pokémon épuise tous les PP de toutes\\nses capacités, sa seule option sera d’utiliser\\r\\nLutte, ce qui le blessera dans le processus.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 140,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_09",
      "hash64": "160D2FAC1FC194E7",
      "text": "Ainsi, il est d’autant plus important d’amener\\nvos Pokémon dans des Centres Pokémon.\\c\\nPour régénérer leurs PV, certes, mais également\\npour qu’ils récupèrent leurs PP.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 168,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_10",
      "hash64": "16102CAC1FC3C5A5",
      "text": "Par ailleurs, certains objets comme l’Huile ou\\nl’Huile Max permettent de récupérer des PP.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_11",
      "hash64": "16102BAC1FC3C3F2",
      "text": "En revanche, faites attention.\\nCes objets ne sont pas vendus en boutique.\\c\\nLa parcimonie est donc de mise si, d’aventure,\\nvous en dénichez lors de vos déplacements.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 166,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_12",
      "hash64": "16102AAC1FC3C23F",
      "text": "Encore une chose... Sachez que plus une capacité\\nest puissante, plus son nombre de PP est faible.\\c\\nUtilisez donc vos capacités judicieusement,\\nafin de ne pas vous retrouver à court de PP\\r\\nau moment décisif.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 188,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 210,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_13",
      "hash64": "161029AC1FC3C08C",
      "text": "Comme vous pouvez le voir, les PV ne sont pas\\nle seul élément à surveiller lors de vos aventures.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_14",
      "hash64": "161028AC1FC3BED9",
      "text": "Vos partenaires Pokémon ont des capacités\\nspectaculaires, c’est indéniable.\\c\\nMais en suivant les préceptes de mon cours,\\nleurs performances n’en seront que meilleures !\\c\\nJe compte sur vous pour vous en souvenir lors\\nde votre Chasse au Trésor.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 170,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 246,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_g_03_home_15",
      "hash64": "161027AC1FC3BD26",
      "text": "Notre leçon est désormais terminée.\\c\\nUn contrôle partiel vous attend pour le prochain\\ncours. Bien réviser est la clé du succès.[VAR 0x0114(0029)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0029"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
